        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natarajan Chandrasekaran\n- Companies: Tata Sons, Tata Consultancy Services (TCS)\n- Roles: Chairman, CEO, COO, executive director\n\nFacts:\n- On November 6, 2009, Natarajan Chandrasekaran became CEO of Tata Consultancy Services (TCS).\n- Before becoming CEO of Tata Consultancy Services (TCS), Natarajan Chandrasekaran was COO and executive director of Tata Consultancy Services (TCS).\n- On 21 February 2017, Natarajan Chandrasekaran took over as Chairman of Tata Sons.",
